on our mind every single week.

00:14:07.279 --> 00:14:08.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
We do it in the community,
we do it on Zoom,

00:14:08.981 --> 00:14:10.816 align:start size:88% position:13%
we read books together,
it's super fun.

00:14:10.816 --> 00:14:13.853
People can join at kb.locals.com

00:14:13.853 --> 00:14:15.588
- That's kb.locals.com,

00:14:15.588 --> 00:14:19.091 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I will see you out
